{
  "id": "school-refusal",
  "term": "school refusal",
  "definition": "School refusal is a persistent or recurring pattern in which a young person has trouble getting to school, staying there, or taking part in school, and the difficulty is expressed by the young person rather than being explained by a single cause. It commonly involves distress or other aversive school-related experiences and can be maintained by different avoidance or reinforcement patterns.",
